# App Store Connect API Key
#
# Required only for TestFlight + App Store distribution (fastlane ios beta,
# fastlane ios release, fastlane mac beta). Simulator builds and on-device
# debug builds don't need this.
#
# To create the key:
#   1. Go to https://appstoreconnect.apple.com/access/integrations/api
#   2. Click "Generate API Key" (or "+")
#   3. Name it anything (e.g. "Primitive CLI"), Role: Admin or App Manager
#   4. Click Generate — note the Key ID and Issuer ID shown on the page
#   5. Download the .p8 file (one-time download — can't be re-downloaded)
#   6. Save the .p8 as fastlane/api_key.p8 and copy this file to fastlane/.env
#
# Then fill in:

ASC_KEY_ID="YOUR_KEY_ID"
ASC_ISSUER_ID="YOUR_ISSUER_ID"
ASC_KEY_PATH="./fastlane/api_key.p8"

# For notarization (DMG only) — uses notarytool keychain profile.
# Set up with:
#   xcrun notarytool store-credentials "primitive-notarytool" \
#     --apple-id "your@email.com" \
#     --team-id "<your-team-id>"
